    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe5e7e8f036412fc6ecfa2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石顺利度过最重要的三年。\n今天她回到老家\n向家人报告往后的方向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef860b06832a8d128dabe86d563695e520c0e292cf5ea8d215afaff40c6c41c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
