      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“靠自己的双腿绽放最耀眼的光芒”──\n看来她的家人接纳了她的这股意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11645f7f348723b7275f58999e00dfb9cbe564c46505d7105f2b087d504a3332",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
